{"asset_key":"ep7/gameplay_story_17600090","episode":"ep7","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"17600090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1760009001:1":{"text":"ヤマト！やっと会えた……！","source_cn":"大和！我终于见到你了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB01E8FCC693F30B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1760009002:1":{"text":"待たせてごめんな、ガブモン。","source_cn":"抱歉，加布兽，让你久等了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3065BB6942A419D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1760009003:0":{"text":"俺のために、頑張ってくれたんだな……本当にありがとう。","source_cn":"谢谢你为我做了这么多……谢谢你，加布兽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A8D9E2AE6845E82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1760009004:0":{"text":"大したことじゃないよ。ヤマトに会えるなら、俺はなんだってするよ！","source_cn":"没关系，只要能和大和再次见面，我什么都愿意做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4606C67F97106DCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1760009005:1":{"text":"でも……俺、いっぱい校則違反しちゃったから、当分は帰してもらえないかも……","source_cn":"只是……大和，我违反了很多校规，可能要被关很久禁闭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A0BF547C19671E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title