","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1760009011:0":{"text":"ヤマト！？","source_cn":"大和！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE5E553AB846BDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1760009012:1":{"text":"ほう？ガブモンが破った校則は一つや二つではない。恐ろしい罰をたーっくさん受けることになるぞ？","source_cn":"哦？加布兽违反了很多校规，要承受的惩罚可是很多、很复杂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69220421BEFF2BF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1760009013:1":{"text":"たとえば……真っ暗で何も聞こえない謹慎室に閉じ込められるとか……","source_cn":"比如……被关在黑暗的、安静的禁闭室里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6204F81713963656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1760009014:1":{"text":"もしくは、レヒラムにあるトロフィーと額縁を一つ残らずピッカピカに磨いてもらうとか……","source_cn":"或者是把莱希拉姆所有陈列的奖杯和画框都擦一遍，一点灰尘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E359F899FEA13A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1760009015:1":{"text":"他にも、温室で毒をもつ魔法植物の栽培をやってもらったり……","source_cn":"又比如，在温室做苦工，培育带毒性的魔法植物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1C82D9C4F6D1284","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","do